      {
        "shot_id": "Shot1",
        "text": "Over five seconds, gray paneled double doors open onto a warmly lit hallway. The Dark-jacket visitor, a short dark-haired man in a black leather jacket over a dark hooded layer and striped gray shirt, with a gold-colored badge on a neck chain, walks into the pale paneled office. The taller Beige-jacket visitor follows, wearing thin metal-framed glasses, a beige jacket and a pale collared shirt. The Doorway woman, blonde with pinned-up hair and a dark sleeveless dress, is briefly visible behind them. Follow the men leftward in a medium view as they enter, keeping the Dark-jacket visitor in front and revealing framed art along the office wall."
      },
      {
        "shot_id": "Shot2",
        "text": "In the daylight office, the Suited man has wavy brown hair and wears a dark suit, a pale pink striped shirt, a red tie and matching pocket square. Reclining in a black chair behind the Wooden office desk, he initially has both black shoes on the desktop and the Small handheld phone beside his face. Across five seconds he lowers his feet, brings the phone down between his hands and leans forward to begin standing. Keep the Open black laptop on the dark writing mat, with loose papers nearby. Behind him, tall gridded windows reveal city buildings, and a metal drinks stand holds a shaker and lidded bucket."
      },
      {
        "shot_id": "Shot3",
        "text": "A wider view across the Wooden office desk places the Dark-jacket visitor in the central foreground, mostly seen from behind, and the Beige-jacket visitor upright at the right. A gentle leftward reframing reveals the Suited man standing behind the desk against the tall city-facing windows. During five seconds, the Suited man gestures near his chest, points toward the visitors, then brings his hands toward his jacket. The Dark-jacket visitor extends his right arm toward the right at the end. Preserve the Open black laptop between the men and the metal drinks stand beside the windows, with pale paneled walls and framed abstract art completing the office."
      },
