        "shot_id": "Shot4",
        "text": "The Beige-jacket visitor stands on the left and the Dark-jacket visitor on the right, framed from about the waist up against the office's gray paneled doorway. Behind them, the Doorway woman looks into the room from the warm hallway. Over five seconds, the Dark-jacket visitor gestures back toward her and briefly turns his head, then lowers his arm and faces forward. She turns away and walks farther down the hallway. The Beige-jacket visitor glances toward his companion, then later turns toward the doorway as the Dark-jacket visitor turns his head left. Keep the open door, glowing hallway sconce and framed black line portrait visible."
      }
